## mcp__ipsys-web__list_file_links
按 FileId 查询同工作区所有有效关联，包含关联 LinkId、所属 FolderId；可用于查明哪些目录共享同一原件。

Parameters:
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "workspace",
    "file_id"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "workspace": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "工作区",
      "enum": [
        "company",
        "personal"
      ]
    },
    "file_id": {
      "type": "integer",
      "description": "原件 FileId，不是 LinkId"
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```

## mcp__ipsys-web__get_file_details
获取 FileId 的元数据及全部有效历史版本（不读取原件字节）。

Parameters:
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "workspace",
    "file_id"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "workspace": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "工作区",
      "enum": [
        "company",
        "personal"
      ]
    },
    "file_id": {
      "type": "integer",
      "description": "实际逻辑 FileId，不是 LinkId"
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false
}
```
